   "value": "<p><strong>Cost:</strong> 500eb (Expensive)</p>\n<p><strong>Mods:</strong> All Smart Rebuild Attachments</p>\n<p><em>Increases the size of the smart-targeting reticle, resulting in superior target tracking and round guidance, but with a slight loss in precision.</em></p>\n<p>The Smart Rebuild no longer provides a +1 bonus to Attack Checks. In exchange, Improved Smart Ammunition fired by the modified Smart Rebuild now re-rolls attacks when missing the DV by 7 or less instead of by 5 or less (e.g., Rolling an 18 on a DV25 Attack Check still causes Improved Smart Ammunition to re-roll the Check as normal).</p>\n<p><strong>Attachment slots:</strong> 0 (Weapon Mod)</p>\n<p><em>From <a href=\"https://docs.google.com/document/d/13EnSAoiLDsC7zmL-Jr1RqIh_EnuVuFnExqiipDVquMk/edit\">Corgo's 77 Collection V3</a> by Corgopolis (Weapons &gt; Mod Catalog &gt; Attachment Mods).</em></p>"
